<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the second</p>
<p>day of Sheffield Shield matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Sydney: New South Wales 296 (Steve Waugh 106, Mark Taylor</p>
<p>53; Mike Kasprowicz 5-110) and 4-0, Queensland 330 (Andrew</p>
<p>Symonds 111, Trevor Barsby 79)</p>
<p>In Melbourne: Victoria 345-9 declared (Dean Jones</p>
<p>152, Ian Harvey 70), South Australia 84 and 44-0</p>
<p>In Perth: Tasmania 473-6 declared (Michael DiVenuto</p>
<p>130, Dene Hills 111, Ricky Ponting 67, Jamie Cox 62), Western</p>
<p>Australia 39-0.</p>
</text>
